/-- Tropical Hecke convolution for GL₂.
This models the convolution in the spherical Hecke algebra
H(GL₂(F)//GL₂(O)) in the tropical semiring.
For coweights λ = (a₁,a₂) and μ = (b₁,b₂), the tropical convolution
