  exact Prod.ext ( by cases hpq ; cases hqp ; cases max_cases p.1 p.2 <;> cases max_cases q.1 q.2 <;> linarith ) ( by cases hpq ; cases hqp ; cases max_cases p.1 p.2 <;> cases max_cases q.1 q.2 <;> linarith )
